WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:05.472 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- God saves the Queen.

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:07.941 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- La reine Élisabeth II a passé

00:00:04.538 --> 00:00:08.942 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sa vie en représentation

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:09.976 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et devant les caméras.

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:13.746 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Pourtant, à bien des égards,

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:14.780 size:53% position:73% line:53%
elle reste mystérieuse

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:15.782 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et énigmatique.

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:16.816 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le réalisateur britannique

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:17.817 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Roger Michell, à qui on doit

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:18.851 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le film "Coup de foudre

00:00:16.917 --> 00:00:20.387 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à Notting Hill", a plongé

00:00:17.918 --> 00:00:21.388 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dans llilililiers d'heures

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:24.491 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'archives publiques et privées

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:25.492 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la souveraine pour assembler

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:26.493 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un portrait en pièces détachées.

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:27.527 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ow! It's my foot

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:28.561 size:53% position:73% line:53%
you're standing on.

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:29.596 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le résultat est

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:30.597 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un documentaire décalé,

00:00:28.662 --> 00:00:31.631 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sans narration, qui ne ressemble

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:34.501 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à rien de ce qui a itititit

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:35.502 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sur la reine et qui la révèle

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:36.536 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sous un nouveau jour.

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:37.570 size:53% position:73% line:53%
MARC LAURENDEAU, journaliste

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:38.605 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Elle a l'air d'une étudi

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:43.243 size:53% position:73% line:53%
quand elle est jeune, même jeune

00:00:37.671 --> 00:00:46.012 size:53% position:73% line:53%
reine. Plus le temps avance,

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:47.013 size:53% position:73% line:53%
plus elle devient zen, grave,

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:51.618 size:53% position:73% line:53%
retenue. Alors, on voit cette

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:53.153 size:53% position:73% line:53%
évolution, c'est-à-dire que

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:53.987 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'est une femme qui est un peui.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:54.020 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- We grew up loving the Queen.

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:54.054 size:53% position:73% line:53%
To us, teenagers,

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:59.292 size:53% position:73% line:53%
she was a babe!

00:00:57.357 --> 00:01:00.327 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le film "Elizabeth :

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:01.361 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Regard(s) singulier(s)"

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:02.395 size:53% position:73% line:53%
enchaîne et entrecroise des

00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:03.396 size:53% position:73% line:53%
moments de la vie de la reine

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:05.565 size:53% position:73% line:53%
captés en vidéo, classés

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:06.566 size:53% position:73% line:53%
par chapitres, de sa passion

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:07.567 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour les chevaux aux drames

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:10.270 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qu'elle a dû affront

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:11.271 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en passant par le poids écrasant

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:12.272 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la couronne.

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:13.306 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- It weighs a ton.

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:15.775 size:53% position:73% line:53%
You can't look down because if

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:16.810 size:53% position:73% line:53%
you did, your neck would break.

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:17.811 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Des images royales,

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:18.845 size:53% position:73% line:53%
toutes plus exceptionnelles et

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:19.879 size:53% position:73% line:53%
surréalistes les unes que les

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:23.149 size:53% position:73% line:53%
autres, eseseseses côte à côte,

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:23.984 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tracent un portrait singulier

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:24.017 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de cette femme de devoir.

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:24.050 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Moi, j'ai beaucoup aimé.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:29.289 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Oui, vraiment, c'est surprenant,

00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:32.559 size:53% position:73% line:53%
créatif, insolite. Surréaliste,

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:33.560 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mais le surréalisme

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:34.561 size:53% position:73% line:53%
a du bon au cinéma.

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:35.562 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- I think everybody

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:36.563 size:53% position:73% line:53%
really will concede on this

00:01:34.661 --> 00:01:37.597 size:53% position:73% line:53%
of all days.

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:38.598 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le résultat est irré

00:01:36.663 --> 00:01:39.632 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mais respectueux. Le fait de

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:42.502 size:53% position:73% line:53%
rester à la surface en reprenant

00:01:38.698 --> 00:01:43.503 size:53% position:73% line:53%
uniquement des images existantes

00:01:39.733 --> 00:01:46.539 size:53% position:73% line:53%
permet de jeter un regard

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:47.540 size:53% position:73% line:53%
différent sur sa vie

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:48.541 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et son destin exceptionnel.

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:49.575 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Does she fell like

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:50.610 size:53% position:73% line:53%
your mother, grandmother

00:01:48.642 --> 00:01:51.644 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Yes, yes.

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:52.679 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Alors que la reine s'apprête à

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:55.215 size:53% position:73% line:53%
célébrer son jubilé de platine,

00:01:51.745 --> 00:01:56.216 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le film "Elizabeth : Regard(s)

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:57.250 size:53% position:73% line:53%
singulier(s)" permet de prendre

00:01:55.315 --> 00:02:00.987 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pleinement conscience que

00:01:56.316 --> 00:02:02.022 size:53% position:73% line:53%
cette femme de 96 ans a été

00:01:57.350 --> 00:02:07.027 size:53% position:73% line:53%
témoin et actrice privilégiéeles

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:09.329 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui ont transformé le monde

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:10.363 size:53% position:73% line:53%
au cours du dernier siècle.

